+# JSON output for the word counter
+
+## Goal
+`node src/cli.mjs <file> --json` prints the counts as one JSON object; without the flag the output stays as it is.
+
+## Decisions
+- Parse the flag in `src/cli.mjs`; `countWords` stays untouched. Rejected: a separate command, because one flag is enough.
+
+## Tasks
+### Task 1: feat(cli): print the counts as JSON with --json
+Depends on: none | Files: `src/cli.mjs`, `test/cli.test.mjs` | Data: stdout is `JSON.stringify(counts)` plus a newline | Proof: node --test test/cli.test.mjs
